<title>UK: Daimler profits more than double in H1.</title>
<headline>Daimler profits more than double in H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>German industrial giant Daimler-Benz AG said on Thursday its group operating profit more than doubled in the first half of 1997 to 1.849 billion marks from 827 million marks in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>The group, Germany's largest, said surging car sales, the weak mark and strict internal cost control were behind the improved performance. It also predicted that its full-year performance would be significantly better than 1996.</p>
</text>
